<section class="band band--flush ab-values">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ab-values__head">
      <p class="eyebrow ab-eyebrow">Mission statement</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="ab-values__list">
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">01</span>
        <h2 class="display">We will place the audience at the very heart of everything we do and seek to empower them through the experiences we create.</h2>
        <p>Our work will blend both moments of epic spectacle with intimate, personal and bespoke encounters.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">02</span>
        <h2 class="display">We will challenge the status quo.</h2>
        <p>We will transform, reinvent and reimagine theatre conventions. For us this means everything from how we hire and work with artists, how we collaborate, how we sell tickets and the nature of our events.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">03</span>
        <h2 class="display">We are a green company.</h2>
        <p>We aim to continue to be one of few arts organisations who are carbon neutral.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">04</span>
        <h2 class="display">We plan to be pioneers of care.</h2>
        <p>This is a central value. We pay ITC rates as standard, and offer free mental health support to all of our artists and freelancers from day one, on an opt-out basis. There will also be at least two trained mental health first aiders on all of our projects.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">05</span>
        <h2 class="display">Our experiences will always be highly ambitious.</h2>
        <p>They will amaze and transport audiences. We will bring more of the marvellous into our everyday lives.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">06</span>
        <h2 class="display">We are a digital company.</h2>
        <p>We use digital technology in our experiences: GPS-locative technology, apps, AI and VR, binaural 360 immersive sound and mobile technologies. We are interested in how technology enhances the live experience.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">07</span>
        <h2 class="display">We strive to ensure that we represent the city of Leeds and the world around us.</h2>
        <p>We celebrate its diversity, and make sure our work is open and available to all.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">08</span>
        <h2 class="display">We are committed to supporting early-career artists in our sector.</h2>
        <p>We will continue to offer paid placements and free resources, such as training workshops and our podcast.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="ab-values__n">09</span>
        <h2 class="display">We are interested in merging different art forms and methods to create innovative, thrilling, theatrical experiences.</h2>
        <p>This means combining genres such as immersive theatre, escape rooms, video games, podcasts, VR, XR and MR, and nightclub and festival experiences.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

